      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1 this post with a US Magic Keyboard (13\" M2 iPad Air, iPadOS 18.1)\n\nMovement keys are extremely sticky. Pressing A/D while already holding W/S will cancel the forward/backwards movement even if those keys remain held.\n\nTrackpad does not work as typical mouse input should on VRChat, instead I am forced to rely on touch input to move the camera.",
